Package: linux-doc-7.2
Architecture: all
Section: doc
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc !pkg.linux.quick>
Built-Using: ${sphinxdoc:Built-Using}
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${sphinxdoc:Depends}
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: Linux kernel specific documentation for version 7.2
 This package provides the various README files and HTML documentation for
 the Linux kernel version 7.2.  Plenty of information, including the
 descriptions of various kernel subsystems, filesystems, driver-specific
 notes and the like.  An index to the documentation is installed as
 /usr/share/doc/linux-doc-7.2/html/index.html.

Package: linux-headers-7.2.12+deb14-amd64
Architecture: amd64
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nokernel !pkg.linux.quick>
Depends: gcc-16-for-host, linux-base (>= 4.12~), linux-base-7.2.12+deb14-amd64 (= ${binary:Version}), linux-headers-7.2.12+deb14-common (= ${source:Version}), linux-kbuild-7.2.12+deb14, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux 7.2.12 for 64-bit PCs (module development)
 This package provides the architecture-specific kernel header files for
 Linux kernel 7.2.12+deb14-amd64, generally used for building out-of-tree
 kernel modules.  These files are going to be installed into
 /usr/src/linux-headers-7.2.12+deb14-amd64, and can be used for building
 modules that load into the kernel provided by the
 linux-image-7.2.12+deb14-amd64 package.

